# Index of Anna's Poems

This source is the website's chronological index of Anna's poems. Its columns are **Title**, **Date**, and **Periodical or source**. It lists the works from “Congress Corruption” (9 December 1937, *Viduthalai*) through the later poems and adaptations collected in this archive.

The Tamil titles and bibliographic entries are retained verbatim above. Each title is represented by a separate bilingual Markdown file in this `kavithaigal` folder, where its English title and full translation can be read without replacing the historical Tamil index.

---NOTES---
This is a catalogue page rather than an individual poem. Its completion is verified against the translated section index generated after the folder audit.

